{"id":"44d3a4bd8308f551","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-resolution-completeness.md","title":"有限命题归结的可靠性与完备性","display":"thm-resolution-completeness — 有限命题归结的可靠性与完备性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-resolution-completeness","aliases":["72-thm-resolution-completeness"],"display":"thm-resolution-completeness — 有限命题归结的可靠性与完备性","depends_on":["[[72-df-davis-putnam-elimination]]","[[72-lem-davis-putnam-projection]]","[[72-lem-resolution-derived-premises]]","[[72-thm-resolution-soundness]]"],"chapter":"I","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.I Theorem1.3.4 and Davis–Putnam proof, print20–21/PDF32–33; proof read and expanded","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local proof recorded and manually reviewed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revised":"2026-10-22"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-resolution-completeness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-resolution-completeness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-resolution-completeness — 有限命题归结的可靠性与完备性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4e6ae3cc72e7164b\" href=\"?note=4e6ae3cc72e7164b\" title=\"72-df-davis-putnam-elimination\">72-df-davis-putnam-elimination</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1a1196fd5e373b39\" href=\"?note=1a1196fd5e373b39\" title=\"72-lem-davis-putnam-projection\">72-lem-davis-putnam-projection</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"79c50f49bb7604ff\" href=\"?note=79c50f49bb7604ff\" title=\"72-lem-resolution-derived-premises\">72-lem-resolution-derived-premises</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"21921243c3156e00\" href=\"?note=21921243c3156e00\" title=\"72-thm-resolution-soundness\">72-thm-resolution-soundness</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"I"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.I Theorem1.3.4 and Davis–Putnam proof, print20–21/PDF32–33; proof read and expanded"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local proof recorded and manually reviewed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-22"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\subseteq\\mathsf{Clause}\">\\(F\\subseteq\\mathsf{Clause}\\)</span> 有限；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Unsat},\\operatorname{ResRefutation}\">\\(\\operatorname{Unsat},\\operatorname{ResRefutation}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Vars},\\operatorname{DP}_p,\\operatorname{ResCl}\">\\(\\operatorname{Vars},\\operatorname{DP}_p,\\operatorname{ResCl}\\)</span> 使用所引本册定义。</li>\n<li>反驳仅使用输入子句和二元归结；不加入削弱、公理重言式或额外扩展变量。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Unsat}(F)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Clause}^{&lt;\\omega}\\ \\operatorname{ResRefutation}(\\pi,F).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Unsat}(F)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Clause}^{&lt;\\omega}\\ \\operatorname{ResRefutation}(\\pi,F).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>可靠性由既有归结可靠性。完备性对有限数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\operatorname{Vars}(F)|\">\\(|\\operatorname{Vars}(F)|\\)</span> 归纳。若为0，所有子句只能为空；不可满足迫使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing\\in F\">\\(\\varnothing\\in F\\)</span>，单行即为反驳。若大于0，取出现变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>；消元投影引理使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{DP}_p(F)\">\\(\\operatorname{DP}_p(F)\\)</span> 不可满足，且其变量数严格减少。由归纳假设有该集合的反驳。消元集合的每个子句或者是原有中性子句，或者是两个原父子句的一次归结，故都在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ResCl}(F)\">\\(\\operatorname{ResCl}(F)\\)</span>；已导出前提引理把反驳提升回 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span>。这补全原书“equisatisfiable”一步的赋值细节，并覆盖重言子句、空集合与空子句。原书还讨论无限输入经紧致性约化；本条仅取当前接口支持的有限输入。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-davis-putnam-elimination","status":"resolved","id":"4e6ae3cc72e7164b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-davis-putnam-elimination]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-lem-davis-putnam-projection","status":"resolved","id":"1a1196fd5e373b39","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-lem-davis-putnam-projection]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-lem-resolution-derived-premises","status":"resolved","id":"79c50f49bb7604ff","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-lem-resolution-derived-premises]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-resolution-soundness","status":"resolved","id":"21921243c3156e00","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-thm-resolution-soundness]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"F\\subseteq\\mathsf{Clause}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Unsat},\\operatorname{ResRefutation}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Vars},\\operatorname{DP}_p,\\operatorname{ResCl}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Unsat}(F)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Clause}^{<\\omega}\\ \\operatorname{ResRefutation}(\\pi,F).","display":true},{"tex":"|\\operatorname{Vars}(F)|","display":false},{"tex":"\\varnothing\\in F","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{DP}_p(F)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ResCl}(F)","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false}],"bytes":2138,"backlinks":[{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-214","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-thm-resolution-completeness|thm-resolution-completeness — 有限命题归结的可靠性与完备性]]"}],"outgoing":["4e6ae3cc72e7164b","1a1196fd5e373b39","79c50f49bb7604ff","21921243c3156e00"]}